/// known-gap: interp has no `on end:` on overlays
/// A field named `on` can be changed in `modifies:`; only `on end:` starts
/// the next clause.
<>Lamp |
    ~on: 2
    ~ended: 0
xx
overlay Bright |
    lasts 2 ticks
    on end: dim
    modifies:
        on + 1
end
act dim(l)
    l >> ended |= 1
xx
l <> Lamp | on: 2
overlay Bright on l at 1
say(l >> on)
tick()
tick()
tick()
say(l >> on)
say(l >> ended)
